    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage Platformer</strong>\u00a0(known as KeNi Adventure) is a fast-paced, precision platformer that delivers a relentless challenge for even the most skilled players. Prepare to embark on a journey filled with deviously designed levels, each packed with complex puzzles and brutal obstacles that demand mastery of timing, agility, and wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving platformer, your patience will be tested as much as your reflexes. Each level brings a unique twist, requiring quick thinking and precise movements to navigate deadly traps and reach the goal. Mistakes are part of the process\u2014learn from them, adapt, and overcome.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage Platformer</strong>\u00a0(known as KeNi Adventure) is a fast-paced, precision platformer that delivers a relentless challenge for even the most skilled players. Prepare to embark on a journey filled with deviously designed levels, each packed with complex puzzles and brutal obstacles that demand mastery of timing, agility, and wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving platformer, your patience will be tested as much as your reflexes. Each level brings a unique twist, requiring quick thinking and precise movements to navigate deadly traps and reach the goal. Mistakes are part of the process\u2014learn from them, adapt, and overcome.</p>",
    "short_description": "Rage Platformer (Formerly known as Keni Adventure) is a great Platform game that has very hard levels and puzzles to solve, you have to be patient &amp; quick and smart to beat them! + Achievements to design your steam profile!",
